Threads is a war, drama, science fiction film directed by Mick Jackson.

3
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Documentary style account of a nuclear holocaust and its effect on the working class city of
Sheffield, England; and the eventual long run effects of nuclear war on civilization.

